    reminderText: Once per card on first Bait attachment, offer up to two distinct
      non-Apex Schooling species eligible at the next biome and depth using normal
      weights. Choose one or decline immediately. One species is a valid offer; zero
      uses the normal draw. Reveal at normal time without advancing depth for the
      choice. A new selection replaces the earlier one and survives source removal.
      Scheduled Apex cannot be replaced; if the actual destination makes the selected
      species ineligible, discard it and draw normally. Mode and biome changes never
      refresh this activation.
